(d) Details of Shareholder’s Complaints
In compliance with Regulation 13 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations 2015, RVNL ensures that adequate steps are taken for expeditious Redressal of investor complaints. RVNL is registered on the SCORES platform or such other electronic platform or system of the Board as shall be mandated from time to time, in order to handle investor complaints electronically in the manner specified by the Board.
The investor shall first take up the matter with the Rail Vikas Nigam Limited (“RVNL”). If the investor is not satisfied with the resolution provided by the RVNL, then the investor may register the complaint/dispute in SCORES/ SMART ODR Portal.
